'' sys/windows (ADR 0017 §19): the facade over windows.bi, beside the header included directly,
'' in a program with no UNICODE. One RECT for both; the facade's unsuffixed names are W --
'' a function, a struct, TCHAR, IDC_ARROW through the W MAKEINTRESOURCE, MAKEINTATOM,
'' SE_DEBUG_NAME through the W __TEXT -- while the program's own stay ANSI (TCHAR is 1).
'' A constant, an anonymous enum's member, FreeBASIC's LOWORD, the renamed Sleep_; then
'' win.CreateWindow, the header's macro, called with win.SE_DEBUG_NAME in its arguments,
'' linked against user32 and run.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/syswin/main.bas -o tests/modules/syswin.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/syswin.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 30 1 2 -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1 32512 5 16 -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 15 2 22136 4660
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1 16 -1
